                                "example_id": "098fe728-22e5-4368-b119-b56b579517bb",
                                "sense_id": "f0520f20-483a-3d89-b52a-d29ccaecb1e7",
                                "text": "The realization that Istra was in the room made him forget most of his melds at pinochle; […]"
